{
  "slug": "gorealo-purchase-budget",
  "name": "GoRealo — Homebuying education",
  "description": "Subject: Before the open house, set your comfort zone | Preheader: A practical way to think about the full monthly cost.",
  "type": "email",
  "builder": "mailpurse",
  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Before the open house, set your comfort zone</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">A practical way to think about the full monthly cost.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #0d6755\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://www.gorealo.com/media/site-assets/gorealo-logo.svg\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#0d6755;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">THE HOMEBUYER EDIT</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">Find your home. Know your numbers.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, it’s easy to focus on a listing price. A confident plan also considers what homeownership may cost month to month and at closing.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">Have you set a monthly range that feels comfortable?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirushtide/mailerfox/main/resources/email-templates/gorealo/assets/HomebuyerSaysYes.png\" alt=\"GoRealo: Homebuying education\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Look beyond principal and interest</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Property taxes, homeowners insurance, mortgage insurance, and association dues may affect your monthly budget.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Plan for cash to close</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Down payment, closing costs, and reserves can all matter. Your actual costs depend on the property and loan.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Leave room for real life</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Choose a payment range that leaves space for the other parts of your budget.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">If you share your rough price range and timeline, we can help you identify useful questions to bring to your home search.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#0d6755\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/mortgage-calculators/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Explore payment scenarios</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "Before the open house, set your comfort zone A practical way to think about the full monthly cost. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR THE HOMEBUYER EDIT Find your home. Know your numbers. Hi {{first_name}}, it’s easy to focus on a listing price. A confident plan also considers what homeownership may cost month to month and at closing. Have you set a monthly range that feels comfortable? Look beyond principal and interest Property taxes, homeowners insurance, mortgage insurance, and association dues may affect your monthly budget. Plan for cash to close Down payment, closing costs, and reserves can all matter. Your actual costs depend on the property and loan. Leave room for real life Choose a payment range that leaves space for the other parts of your budget. If you share your rough price range and timeline, we can help you identify useful questions to bring to your home search. Warmly, The GoRealo Team Explore payment scenarios Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
  "builder_data": {
